1
00:00:00,004 --> 00:00:02,144
You print papers from nothing

2
00:00:02,144 --> 00:00:04,144
(called "monetary policy").

3
00:00:04,144 --> 00:00:05,364
You give these nothing-papers

4
00:00:05,364 --> 00:00:07,024
to weapons makers.

5
00:00:07,064 --> 00:00:07,784
They make things

6
00:00:07,784 --> 00:00:10,044
that destroy everything.

7
00:00:10,044 --> 00:00:11,484
This creates "jobs" which

8
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:13,264
give people papers.

9
00:00:13,264 --> 00:00:14,404
People use papers to buy

10
00:00:14,404 --> 00:00:17,304
food (which grows for free).

11
00:00:17,344 --> 00:00:19,704
This is called "the economy".

12
00:00:20,064 --> 00:00:21,844
One downside of this system is that

13
00:00:21,844 --> 00:00:23,724
it has killed three hundred and ten

14
00:00:23,724 --> 00:00:26,574
million of you in your assorted wars.

15
00:00:26,624 --> 00:00:28,164
On my planet, we skip the

16
00:00:28,164 --> 00:00:29,784
mass murder step and just give

17
00:00:29,784 --> 00:00:32,224
people food directly, but that's probably

18
00:00:32,224 --> 00:00:33,984
too advanced for you.
